coach "Man Press"
about "Corners in their faces, man across the board with one safety deep."

defense:
  when game ending and leading -> call "Cover 3"
  when third down and to go under 4 -> call "Cover 0 Blitz" or "Cover 1"
  otherwise -> call "Cover 1" or "Cover 1" or "Cover 2"

lineup:
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Center Fielder"
